  "description": "Aviral is a multi play station in Banana Yellow with a minimal, open design. Its standout feature is an overhead hopscotch ladder, and the photos show it standing on a yellow hopscotch-pattern safety surface. Children climb spring climbers, cross an overhead net bridge and come down by a tube slide or an open slide. The station is open to ages 3 to 12, so younger siblings can play alongside older children. It takes up to 15 children, covers 27'5\" x 21'9\" and needs a safe play area of 32'5\" x 26'9\". Sliding, climbing and hopping build coordination, cooperative play, creativity and confidence with height. The pipes, moulded parts, laminates and rope carry a 3-year warranty. Ask us for a quote for your park or society.",
